<view class="completion-submit-box">
  <button class="completion-extra-entry" bindtap="openExtras">
    <view class="completion-extra-main">
      <view class="completion-extra-title">完工说明 / 维修保障 <text>选填</text></view>
      <view class="completion-extra-summary">{{draftDescription || draftWarrantyMonths || draftWarrantyNote ? '已填写，可继续修改' : '仅有约定或补充说明时填写'}}</view>
    </view>
    <text class="cuIcon-right"></text>
  </button>
  <button class="cu-btn block round bg-cyan text-white submit-completion-btn" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">{{submitting ? '正在提交' : '提交完工'}}</button>
</view>

<view class="cu-modal bottom-modal {{showExtras ? 'show' : ''}}" catchtouchmove="true">
  <view class="cu-dialog completion-extra-dialog">
    <view class="cu-bar bg-white">
      <view class="action text-grey" bindtap="closeExtras">取消</view>
      <view class="content text-bold">补充完工信息</view>
      <view class="action text-cyan" bindtap="saveExtras">保存</view>
    </view>
    <view class="completion-extra-body text-left">
      <view class="completion-extra-tip"><text class="cuIcon-infofill"></text> 完工照片是必填项；以下内容仅在双方确有约定或需要补充说明时填写，不会自动新增保障承诺。</view>
      <view class="completion-extra-field">
        <text>完工说明 <text class="optional-tag">选填</text></text>
        <textarea maxlength="1000" placeholder="例如：已完成全部施工，现场已清理" value="{{draftDescription}}" bindinput="inputDescription"></textarea>
      </view>
      <view class="completion-extra-field">
        <text>维修保障 <text class="optional-tag">选填</text></text>
        <view class="completion-warranty-options">
          <text class="cu-tag round {{draftWarrantyMonths === '6' ? 'bg-cyan text-white' : 'line-grey'}}" data-months="6" bindtap="selectWarranty">半年</text>
          <text class="cu-tag round {{draftWarrantyMonths === '12' ? 'bg-cyan text-white' : 'line-grey'}}" data-months="12" bindtap="selectWarranty">1 年</text>
          <text class="cu-tag round {{draftWarrantyMonths === '24' ? 'bg-cyan text-white' : 'line-grey'}}" data-months="24" bindtap="selectWarranty">2 年</text>
          <text class="cu-tag round {{draftWarrantyMonths === 'custom' ? 'bg-cyan text-white' : 'line-grey'}}" data-months="custom" bindtap="selectWarranty">自填</text>
        </view>
        <input wx:if="{{draftWarrantyMonths === 'custom'}}" type="number" maxlength="3" placeholder="保障月数，例如 18" value="{{draftCustomWarrantyMonths}}" bindinput="inputCustomWarranty"/>
        <textarea maxlength="500" placeholder="保障范围或双方约定说明（选填）" value="{{draftWarrantyNote}}" bindinput="inputWarrantyNote"></textarea>
        <view wx:if="{{draftWarrantyMonths}}" class="completion-warranty-clear">再次点击当前已选期限可取消保障设置。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
